      "teachingContent": {
        "schemaVersion": "objective-teaching-content-v1",
        "sourceTextId": "text:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven:source",
        "sourceAssetVersion": 1,
        "translation": {
          "textId": "text:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven:translation",
          "legacyField": "fullTranslationZh",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:1",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:1"
              ],
              "start": 0,
              "end": 99,
              "quote": "作为一名在社交媒体上分享自己艺术历程的艺术家，常有好奇的关注者问我怎样开始学艺术。遗憾的是，我给不出什么神奇的清单。不过，我确实还记得自己完全是个新手时的样子。所以我整理了几条开始艺术之旅的好建议。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:2",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:2"
              ],
              "start": 101,
              "end": 185,
              "quote": "●从小处做起。我建议用素描本做些小幅习作。这些小习作能带来灵感，将来也可能成为创作更复杂作品的跳板。别把你初学时的作品扔掉。你会想回顾自己的历程，看看自己已经走了多远。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:3",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:3"
              ],
              "start": 187,
              "end": 261,
              "quote": "●常画，并且写生。想进步，没有比多动笔更好的办法了。不管你画静物、肖像还是风景，都要尽可能对着实物画。你会练出只有靠反复练习才能形成的绘画肌肉记忆。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:4",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:4"
              ],
              "start": 263,
              "end": 349,
              "quote": "●不断挑战自己，尝试新东西。走出你的舒适区。艺术上的成长可能有点痛苦。欢迎入伙，我们都经历过。我喜欢接受挑战。我曾经接受过一项挑战：一个月里每天画一幅画，并把作品发到网上。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:5",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:5"
              ],
              "start": 351,
              "end": 442,
              "quote": "●如果你觉得自在，就分享你的作品。寻求并接受建设性的反馈对成长至关重要。我把作品发到社交媒体上，也因此结识了一些特别友善的人。无论我的艺术水平如何，他们都让我觉得自己受重视、被尊重。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:6",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:6"
              ],
              "start": 444,
              "end": 505,
              "quote": "你所走的这条路不会是一条直路。你会遇到障碍，有时也会感到灰心。坚持下去，给自己时间，并付出努力。你终将收获艺术人生的回报。"
            }
          ]
        },
        "completedSourceTexts": [
          {
            "textId": "text:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven:completed:36",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:2",
            "text": "●Start small. I suggest using a sketchbook (素描本) for small studies. These small studies provide inspiration and may be a springboard for more complex works in the future. Don’t throw away your beginner art. You’ll want to look back on your journey to see how far you’ve come."
          },
          {
            "textId": "text:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven:completed:37",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:3",
            "text": "●Paint often and paint from life. There’s no better way to improve than to put in those brush miles. Whether you paint still lifes, portraits, or landscapes, paint from life as much as possible. You’ll develop that painting muscle memory that only comes with repetition."
          },
          {
            "textId": "text:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven:completed:38",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:4",
            "text": "●Continually challenge yourself to try something new. Get out of your comfort zone. Artistic growth can be a bit painful. Welcome to the club; we’ve all been there. I love taking on challenges. I once took up a challenge to create a painting every day for a month and post the works online."
          },
          {
            "textId": "text:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven:completed:39",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:5",
            "text": "● Share your work if you feel comfortable doing so. Seeking and accepting constructive feedback(反馈) is crucial to growth. I post my work on social media and, in turn, have met some of the kindest people. They make me feel valued and respected, no matter my level of artistic ability."
          },
          {
            "textId": "text:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven:completed:40",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-ii:seven-choices:6",
            "text": "The journey you’re on won’t follow a straight path. You’ll hit roadblocks, and you’ll feel discouraged at times. Push through, give it time and put in the effort. You will harvest the rewards of an artistic life."
          }
        ],
